## Localization table (sole owner: WS-Loc; other workstreams send key lists). Ukrainian is the
## primary language, English the fallback. Keys follow arsenal_design.md §9.5 / §11 and
## heroes_design.md §12.4. `python3 tools/loc_lint.py` checks every row (glossary §1.3, one display
## name per thing, placeholders, no literal numbers in hero copy, M PLUS Rounded 1c coverage).
##
## Heroes & Champions: the rows between the HEROES BEGIN / END markers are new keys only, so the
## shipped game (EconData.HEROES_PHASE below HEROES_LIVE_PHASE) never reads them. Rows that change a
## 2.2.1 value (hero names, ST_SEAL «Тавро», gem names for machine rarities, ...) live in
## HEROES_LIVE and apply only once EconData.heroes_live() is true.

